  "description": {
   "en": "At the edge of the universe drifts a solitary vessel. Within its confines, a man serves an “eternal imprisonment”. Through the endless passage of time, he becomes the first to create “something” unprecedented in space… Thus begins a tale that shapes the cosmos, crafted by the author of *The Vertical World*, Tanaka Kuu. (MANGA Plus)",
   "ja": "宇宙の果てに辿り着いた一隻の船。\nその中には、「懲役無限年」の罪に服す男がいた。\n気が遠くなるほどの時間の中で、男は宇宙で初めて「あるモノ」を作り出し…\n『タテの国』田中空が紡ぐ、宇宙を形作る物語がここに。"
